o? What's your answer?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_56","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_56","text":"Well, food is limited in the Ark.","jump":"d_nikke_crow_02_58","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_57","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_57","text":"Well, living space is limited in the Ark.","jump":"d_nikke_crow_02_58","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_58","text":"... Hmm, I see.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_59","text":"So what you're saying is, there are more people in the Ark than its limited resources can support,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_60","text":"and someone had to draw the short straw.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_61","text":"And they just happened to end up an outlaw.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_62","text":"Then why can't I look the other way when it comes to that shooter?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_63","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_63","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_64","text":"I'm not joking. Every person he takes out means one less mouth for the Ark to feed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_65","text":"Which means fewer resources are needed to keep the Ark running.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_66","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_66","text":"Is that really why you didn't stop the shooter?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_67","text":"... You seem awfully prone to pointless doubts.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_68","text":"So let me ask you something.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_69","text":"What if you'd been there that day instead of me?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_70","text":"Would you have shot that outlaw? Or...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_71","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_71","text":"I would have stopped him from killing the reporters, at least.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_72","text":"Then who's going to avenge that outlaw?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_73","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_73","text":"The law.","jump":"d_nikke_crow_02_75","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_74","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_74","text":"People willing to stand with them.","jump":"d_nikke_crow_02_81","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_75","text":"Wrong.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_76","text":"Why do you think they're called outlaws in the first place?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_77","text":"Because they're outside the protection of the law.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_78","text":"Enikk says only citizens have the right to peaceful assembly and freedom of association.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EnikkRoom","bgArt":"enikkroom","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["enikk"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_79","text":"In other words, an outlaw who isn't a citizen has, in principle,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_80","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_80","text":"no legal recourse when they're wronged.","jump":"d_nikke_crow_02_88","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_81","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_81","text":"Hmm...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_82","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_82","text":"It's hard to expect citizens to band together with outlaws who make a living by exploiting them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_83","text":"So the \"people\" you're talking about would have to be other outlaws in the same situation, with nowhere else to turn.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_84","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_84","text":"But here's the problem. Outlaws don't have citizenship.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_85","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_85","text":"According to Enikk, only citizens have the right to peaceful assembly and freedom of association.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EnikkRoom","bgArt":"enikkroom","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["enikk"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_86","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_86","text":"So when outlaws band together in a nonviolent protest,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_87","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_87","text":"it's not tolerated. At least, not here in the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_88","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_88","text":"Well, if shooting up the place was his only option, what else could he do?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Jail","bgArt":"jail","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["crow"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_89","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_89","text":"... That's more or less why I left him alone.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_90","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_90","text":"Is that explanation good enough for you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_91","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_91","text":"... I have another question.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_92","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_92","text":"Go ahead.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_93","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_93","text":"Do you think this way because you used to be an outlaw yourself?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_94","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_94","text":"... What?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_95","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_95","text":"Hey, wait a minute.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_96","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_96","text":"Why are we talking about me all of a sudden?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_97","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_97","text":"I'm a Commander, and I'm here to make sure you're doing okay.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_98","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_98","text":"So naturally, I have to focus on you above everything else.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_99","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_99","text":"... Hmm.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_100","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_100","text":"You always manage to ask pointed questions when I least expect it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_101","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_101","text":"I don't particularly like talking about myself, but if you really want an answer...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_102","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_102","text":"The answer is yes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_103","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_103","text":"I was born in the place where all the Ark's filth ends up.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"OuterRim","bgArt":"outerrim","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_104","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_104","text":"I've seen how that filth can corrupt even the purest of people.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Backstreet","bgArt":"backstreet","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_105","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_105","text":"The shooter who killed those reporters can't exactly be called innocent.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Jail","bgArt":"jail","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["crow"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_106","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_106","text":"But if you feel like casting stones at him, ask yourself...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_107","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_107","text":"Is he really the one at fault?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_108","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_108","text":"Or is it the people who created an oppressed class called Outlaws?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Ark","bgArt":"ark","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_109","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_109","text":"And are you one of them?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_110","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_110","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_111","type":"Narration","speaker":"Narration","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_111","text":"That night, in the Commander's Room...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"CommanderRoom_n","bgArt":"commanderroom_n","image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_112","type":"Monologue","speaker":"Monologue","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_112","text":"In the silence, I go over my conversation with Crow, mulling over everything she said.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_113","type":"Monologue","speaker":"Monologue","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_113","text":"From what I can gather, she must be...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_114","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_114","text":"Covering for the criminal out of that old Outlaw sense of solidarity.","jump":"d_nikke_crow_02_117","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_115","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_115","text":"Trying to send me some kind of message through this.","jump":"d_nikke_crow_02_117","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_116","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_116","text":"Never mind, it's too soon to say.","jump":"d_nikke_crow_02_117","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_02_117","type":"Narration","speaker":"Narration","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_02_117","text":"*Beep*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_recognition_underworld","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}